  "notes": "Fish It! is a fishing game from Fish Atelier, inspired by Fisch and Fishing Simulator. You click to charge up your cast, then click as fast as you can to reel in the fish. Every catch can roll a different size and mutation, so there are over a million versions to collect. You sell fish for coins, buy better rods and bait, and sail to new islands, like the limited Arcadia island from the latest update.\n\nMost Fish It! codes give Luck II or Mutation II potions, plus the odd cosmetic like a halo or lantern. Luck II potions are the best pick when you are hunting a secret fish, so drink them before a long fishing session. New codes tend to show up with big updates, like goals and holidays, and every code needs you to be at least level 10.",
